	)
	(text "Notes: It works, but the original does seem to pull it \noff ground slightly with the tape relay voltage, not sure\nif that is intentional."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 65.024 183.642 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "85c687c9-4816-4173-beec-ef3f612d03a8")
	)
	(text "Sub-note: For 74HCT the centre would be 1.4V, making the lower half 18K. The adjustment doesn't\ngive a nice resistor value, so it'd be somewhere around 17K, so 15K or 18K would be from\na standard set."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.608 193.294 0)
